OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation after boy, 14, fell
OL,4,Afrom bus window
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has said it has launched an
OL,7,Finvestigation after a 14-year-old boy
OL,8,Ffell from a top-floor window of a
OL,9,Fdouble-decker bus.
OL,11,FCambridgeshire Police said it was
OL,12,Fcalled to the incident in Doddington
OL,13,FRoad, Wimblington, at about 15:50 BST
OL,14,Fon Wednesday.
OL,16,FA Cambridgeshire County Council
OL,17,Fspokesperson said its health and safety
OL,18,Fteam was "working closely with the
OL,19,Fpolice and the operator and will be
OL,20,Ffully investigating the circumstances
OL,21,Faround this serious incident".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
