OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation after boy, 14, fell
OL,4,Afrom bus window
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boy was initially taken to
OL,7,FPeterborough City Hospital before being
OL,8,Ftransferred to Addenbrooke's Hospital,
OL,9,Fin Cambridge, where he remains with
OL,10,Fserious but not life-threatening
OL,11,Finjuries.
